                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Subinclosure]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Draft of a Proclamation</hi>
                </head>
                <p>[This is the draft by Captain Knapp, Commander of the Cruiser Squadron of the
                    Atlantic Fleet; it was sent to the President and by him amended and returned
                    with his letter of November 26, post. For the proclamation as issued by Captain
                    Knapp, see inclosure with Mr. Brewer’s No. 143 of December 6, post.]</p>
            </div>
